  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "只要角色保持静止，装置就会冻结周围时间，让被包围时也能停下来规划破局。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Moma has a \"biotope jammer\", an incredible device that stops time around her as long as she also stays motionless.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把不同形状的方块拼成两件装备，同类方块相邻还能升级，枪械和盾牌都由玩家自制。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Moma can craft two pieces of equipment by combining different types of blocks. Some blocks can be upgraded by being placed with others of the same type. Use them wisely to craft any weapon, from long-range guns to sturdy shields.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "商店采用看人脸色的以物易物：报价合适能捡便宜，贪心则会惹怒店主并抬高价格。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Barter with the shopkeepers while keeping a keen eye on the value of your offer and the shopkeepers' mood to get the best deal possible. If it goes well, they might offer you valuable items at bargain prices, but if you get too greedy, you risk upsetting the shopkeeper, who might hike the prices in response.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2555950/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
